voca/styletts.py and the StyleTTS 2 section of voca/losses.py are ported
(modified, scaled down, retrained from scratch; no pretrained weights) from:

* StyleTTS 2, https://github.com/yl4579/StyleTTS2 (commit 5cedc71c),
  MIT License, reproduced below: models.py, losses.py,
  Modules/discriminators.py, Modules/istftnet.py.
* Kokoro, https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro (commit dfb907a0), Apache
  License 2.0 (full text in voca/LICENSE-tiny-voca): kokoro/modules.py,
  kokoro/istftnet.py, itself adapted from StyleTTS 2.

